# Large training checkpoints (df_clean.pkl, split_chrono.pkl — can be GBs)
Offline2/checkpoints/
# Keep artifacts (model.pkl, scaler.pkl, explainer.pkl, feature_list.pkl)
# but ignore any auto-generated confusion matrix PNGs if they get large
Offline2/artifacts/confusion_matrix*.png

